  "name": "Native early landing ends a flight at the next discovered flight point",
  "contract": "During a flight the original action bar's leave button calls TaxiRequestEarlyLanding(), which Extensions.dll sends as the empty CMSG_TAXI_REQUEST_EARLY_LANDING (0x05F2). Retail's early landing ends the flight at the next discovered flight point on its route and drops the rest, unless that point is already the destination; each leg is paid when it starts (Stormwind to Lakeshire 210 copper, Lakeshire to Darkshire 330). Expected: a Stormwind - Lakeshire - Darkshire flight asked to land early during its first leg keeps flying, now ends at Lakeshire, lands there, and never pays the Darkshire leg.",
